{
  "$comment": [
    "Default session layout, modeled on the `mux` function in ~/.functions.",
    "",
    "Each tab gets a BSP tree handed to the herdr `layout.apply` socket method.",
    "  pane   -> { \"label\": name, \"run\": shell command (optional),",
    "              \"requires_repo\": run inside a checkout, see default_repo }",
    "  split  -> { \"direction\": \"right\"|\"down\", \"ratio\": 0-1, \"first\": node, \"second\": node }",
    "",
    "`run` commands are wrapped so the pane drops back to an interactive shell",
    "when the program exits, instead of the tab going dead.",
    "`{plugin_root}` in a `run` string expands to this directory.",
    "Panes with no `run` are plain shells rooted at the space cwd.",
    "",
    "`requires_repo` panes use the space cwd when it is a checkout, and fall back",
    "to default_repo when it is not (a space rooted at ~, say).",
    "",
    "A tab marked `primary_only` is skipped when spaces get the layout",
    "automatically, so global monitors exist once instead of once per project."
  ],
  "focus_tab": 1,
  "default_repo": "~/Code/personal/larakelley.com",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "shell",
      "layout": {
        "type": "split",
        "direction": "right",
        "ratio": 0.5,
        "first": { "type": "pane", "label": "main" },
        "second": {
          "type": "split",
          "direction": "down",
          "ratio": 0.5,
          "first": { "type": "pane", "label": "scratch" },
          "second": { "type": "pane", "label": "watch" }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "agents",
      "layout": {
        "type": "split",
        "direction": "right",
        "ratio": 0.5,
        "first": { "type": "pane", "label": "agent 1" },
        "second": { "type": "pane", "label": "agent 2" }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "editor",
      "layout": { "type": "pane", "label": "nvim", "run": "nvim" }
    },
    {
      "label": "git",
      "layout": {
        "type": "split",
        "direction": "right",
        "ratio": 0.5,
        "first": { "type": "pane", "label": "lazygit", "run": "lazygit", "requires_repo": true },
        "second": { "type": "pane", "label": "git", "requires_repo": true }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "review",
      "layout": { "type": "pane", "label": "tuicr", "run": "tuicr tui", "requires_repo": true }
    },
    {
      "label": "prs",
      "layout": {
        "type": "pane",
        "label": "ghzinga",
        "run": "bash {plugin_root}/prs.sh",
        "requires_repo": true
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "system",
      "primary_only": true,
      "layout": {
        "type": "split",
        "direction": "right",
        "ratio": 0.5,
        "first": { "type": "pane", "label": "glances", "run": "glances" },
        "second": { "type": "pane", "label": "journal", "run": "journalctl -f" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
